Package: hfsis
Title: Adaptive Spot Support Screening for High-Frequency Regression
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Haibin", "Zhu", email = "haibinzhu@jnu.edu.cn",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements adaptive variable screening for synchronous,
    equally spaced high-frequency regression increments. The package provides
    coordinatewise jump truncation, marginal spot independence screening
    (M-SIS), and partial-residual spot iterative screening (PR-SISIS) with
    active-set adaptive window selection. Correlation columns required by
    PR-SISIS are computed on demand as the active set grows.
